# API & data layer

## Endpoints

```dart
abstract final class LiveSessionsEndpoints {
  static const String liveSessions = '/mobile/user/live-sessions';
}
```

Prefer `/mobile/user/...` (auth). Open bootstrap uses `/open/mobile/...`.

## Retrofit client

```dart
@lazySingleton
@RestApi()
abstract class XApiClient {
  @factoryMethod
  factory XApiClient(DioClient dioClient) => _XApiClient(dioClient.dio);

  @GET(XEndpoints.path)
  @Extra({NetworkConstants.forceRefreshExtraKey: true})
  Future<HttpResponse<Model>> getThing();
}
```

## Models

- `@JsonSerializable()` + `part '...g.dart'` (not freezed for DTOs)
- Implement `ModelToEntityMapper<Entity>` with `toEntity()`
- Wire enums as `int` / `List<int>` → `Enum.fromWire`

## Datasource / repository

- DS: thin wrapper returning models / `response.data`
- Repo impl: `XRepositoryImpl` in `data/repositories/` with `@LazySingleton(as: XRepository)`
- Map to entities; return `Either` (API repos use `ErrorHandler`; SDK adapters may map locally)
- SDK-backed ports (RevenueCat, etc.) still use `*RepositoryImpl` — never `*Service`
